cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this benchmark, please cite it as below."
title: "Accord-Benchmark: A Benchmark Suite for Smart Legal Contract Tasks using Accord Project Templates"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible benchmark suite measuring how well large language models
  perform smart legal contract tasks defined over the Accord Project Cicero
  template library: clause classification, variable extraction, type mapping,
  Concerto data-model generation with compiler validation and a
  self-correction loop, and executable logic synthesis scored behaviourally
  against the templates' own unit tests.
authors:
